data: {"type": "TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT", "timestamp": 1793768057202, "messageId": "8d66607f6d", "delta": "With heating return temperature 50 °C, 1D-HP-EC-N1-FC with its present sizes covers 100% of the heat and 100% of the cold. Heat and cold cost 62.8 €/MWh (was 66.6); the CO₂ saving against gas is 59.7% (was 48.8%). The heat exchanger gives 50.8% of the heat (was 37.4%), the heat pump 18.5% (was 19.7%) and the boiler 30.7% (was 42.9%). The brine goes back at 42.6 °C at the coldest (was 52.1 °C). Against gas under the change (gas boilers and chillers at the same prices): NPV 33.7 M€ (was 26.1 M€), paying back in year 10. Searching again under the change picks 1D-HP-EC-N1-FC-PV1.7 at 60.1 €/MWh instead of 1D-HP-EC-N1-FC: 1 doublet at 2,500 m, heat pump top-up and a gas boiler (3 units), electric chillers, sized so that any one unit can be out (N-1): boiler and chillers in equal units."}

data: {"type": "TEXT_MESSAGE_END", "timestamp": 1793768057202, "messageId": "8d66607f6d"}

